# Generated by `pnpm bootstrap` from worker/wrangler.toml.example, and then permanently modified:
# it carries this deployment's real Cloudflare KV namespace ids. Tracking it made every working
# copy dirty by design, so any edit to the file -- a comment tidy-up was enough -- aborted the
# next `git pull` with "your local changes would be overwritten by merge". Ignoring it also means
# a stray `git add -A` cannot publish a real namespace id.
worker/wrangler.toml
.preflight-export/
.ci-export/
